  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Good Shepherd Sisters PROJECT: The overall project objective by the local organisation Levantate Mujer is to contribute to the improvement of specialized victim services and the prevention system against human trafficking in El Alto, La Paz, Sucre and Yapacan&#xed;, by strengthening the capacities of strategic sectors and key stakeholders in civil society and government institutions. Activities include online training course for officials and first line responders, research on the reporting of human trafficking cases, referral and specialized care to survivors of sexual exploitation and abuse.</narrative>
  </description>
